{"id":"6a1ff87567369c3c","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-formal-system.md","title":"Formal System","display":"df-formal-system — Formal System","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-formal-system","aliases":["92-df-formal-system"],"display":"df-formal-system — Formal System","depends_on":[],"source":"第 I 章 pp. 5–6；第 III 章 p. 30；第 V 章 p. 57（PDF 22–23、47、74）","source_status":"本地一般演绎结构"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-formal-system"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-formal-system</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-formal-system — Formal System"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 I 章 pp. 5–6；第 III 章 p. 30；第 V 章 p. 57（PDF 22–23、47、74）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"本地一般演绎结构"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-formal-system-—-Formal-System-$\\mathcal{F}$\">df-formal-system — Formal System <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F}\">\\(\\mathcal{F}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F}\">\\(\\mathcal{F}\\)</span> (candidate set-theoretic triple)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FormalSys}\">\\(\\mathrm{FormalSys}\\)</span> (definition-target predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}formal\\text{-}system} \\vdash \\mathrm{FormalSys}(\\mathcal{F}) \\leftrightarrow \\exists \\Sigma\\,\\exists A\\,\\exists R\\;\\bigl(\\mathcal{F}=(\\Sigma,A,R) \\land A\\subseteq\\Sigma^{&lt;\\omega} \\land R\\subseteq(\\Sigma^{&lt;\\omega})^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\Sigma^{&lt;\\omega}\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}formal\\text{-}system} \\vdash \\mathrm{FormalSys}(\\mathcal{F}) \\leftrightarrow \\exists \\Sigma\\,\\exists A\\,\\exists R\\;\\bigl(\\mathcal{F}=(\\Sigma,A,R) \\land A\\subseteq\\Sigma^{&lt;\\omega} \\land R\\subseteq(\\Sigma^{&lt;\\omega})^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\Sigma^{&lt;\\omega}\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FormalSys}(\\mathcal{F})\">\\(\\mathrm{FormalSys}(\\mathcal{F})\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F}\">\\(\\mathcal{F}\\)</span>是形式系统</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> : 符号表/签名</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> : 公理集</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> : 有限前提序列到结论的推理规则关系</li>\n<li>此处三元组是本地演绎结构约定；原书抽象语言及有效性术语另见来源说明</li>\n<li>这是最基础的概念，无前置依赖</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>本库三元组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Sigma,A,R)\">\\((\\Sigma,A,R)\\)</span> 是一般有限推理结构，并不把有效性塞进“FormalSys”。原书第 I 章使用含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E,S,P,R,H,\\Phi,T\">\\(E,S,P,R,H,\\Phi,T\\)</span> 的抽象语言；第 V 章则把 formal/r.e./axiomatizable system 用于定理码集是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 的系统。不能把原书术语直接等同于本地无有效性限制的三元组。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 I 章 pp. 5–6；第 III 章 p. 30；第 V 章 p. 57（PDF 22–23、47、74）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-formal-system-—-Formal-System-$\\mathcal{F}$","text":"df-formal-system — Formal System $\\mathcal{F}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal{F}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{F}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FormalSys}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}formal\\text{-}system} \\vdash \\mathrm{FormalSys}(\\mathcal{F}) \\leftrightarrow \\exists \\Sigma\\,\\exists A\\,\\exists R\\;\\bigl(\\mathcal{F}=(\\Sigma,A,R) \\land A\\subseteq\\Sigma^{<\\omega} \\land R\\subseteq(\\Sigma^{<\\omega})^{<\\omega}\\times\\Sigma^{<\\omega}\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FormalSys}(\\mathcal{F})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{F}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"(\\Sigma,A,R)","display":false},{"tex":"E,S,P,R,H,\\Phi,T","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false}],"bytes":1596,"backlinks":[{"id":"62f011418ee9c44e","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ffee1dd616b0911b","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal F=(\\Sigma_G,A,R)$ with $\\mathrm{FormalSys}(\\mathcal F)$ (formal system over the coded signature, see [[92-df-formal-system]])"},{"id":"35c764f4e9f21f28","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal{F}$ (formal system, see [[92-df-formal-system]])"},{"id":"a433d8f87b4f42f5","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c04baacf4202d9f7","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c7befd96bd551ade","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"360e00ddf38f0f16","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal F=(\\Sigma_G,A,R)$ (formal system over $\\Sigma_G$, see [[92-df-formal-system]])"},{"id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FormalSys}$ (formal-system predicate, see [[92-df-formal-system]])"},{"id":"e69e849d9714457a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$F,H\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$；有限证明三元组约定见 [[92-df-formal-system]]。"},{"id":"23b675b1348a813e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal F=(\\Sigma,A,R)$ with $\\mathrm{FormalSys}(\\mathcal F)$ (formal system, see [[92-df-formal-system]])"},{"id":"51c43e0240787ebb","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal{F}=(\\Sigma,A,R)$ (formal system, see [[92-df-formal-system]])"},{"id":"920841c1841d30c3","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$J_E=\\{1,2,3\\},J_A=\\{1,2\\}$；系统三元组约定见 [[92-df-formal-system]]。"},{"id":"975b3aa9a1e08797","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"bb22eb42bae0cef9","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"这里直接定义的是理论$\\mathrm{Th}(G^\\omega)$；它未自动给出符合[[92-df-formal-system]]之有限规则格式的形式系统三元组"},{"id":"8fc3493dd14e033d","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal{F}$ (formal system, see [[92-df-formal-system]])"},{"id":"f9f1d74ed907c53b","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal F=(\\Sigma_G,A,R)$ (formal system in the fixed arithmetic language, see [[92-df-formal-system]])"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-formal-system]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-65","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-formal-system]]"}],"outgoing":[]}